# home-from-quicksave -- return-nav from the QuickSaver BACK to home.
# [stol:ui-planner-cov-starts] Start context(quicksave) (reached by
# nav_home_to_quicksave) forces A* to route back via nav_quicksave_to_home. The
# SETUP route home->quicksave is driven first at --run but is NOT measured.
# start: context(quicksave)
context(home)
